<title>USA: Continental Health listing on Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Continental Health listing on Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD CLIFFS, N.J. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Health Affiliates Inc said the company's common shares will be listed on the Nasdaq SmallCap market under the symbol CTHL.O from Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company was previously listed on the bulletin board.</p>
<p>Continental Health Affiliates Inc provides integrated alternative health care. The company owns and operates seven long-term health care facilities and two retirement living communities.</p>
